# A clear work order that needs one npm package in the playground (an npm
# project with a lockfile): the plan lists exactly that dependency change —
# its folder, the package, add, runtime — for the build to apply itself, and
# doesn't edit package.json or the lockfile in its changes.
TITLE="Format durations in the playground with the ms package"
EXPECT_STATUS=ready
EXPECT_CHANGES=""
EXPECT_DEPENDENCY="playground ms add runtime"
